<title>HONG KONG: PCL Enterprises 9-month net HK$1.03 mln.</title>
<headline>PCL Enterprises 9-month net HK$1.03 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   0.3 gain    vs  3.8 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	   vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  3.03 loss   vs  7.57 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    1.03 profit vs  11.40 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     209.41	vs  199.56</p>
<p>    Company name		 PCL Enterprises Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 3-5</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - PCL Enterprises, formerly Win Win International Holdings Ltd, distributes textile machinery.</p>
<p>The company changed its financial year-end to December 31 from March 31. The change is to make the group's financial year coterminous with that of its controlling shareholder, Texan Management Ltd, and the effect of the change on the group's operating results will not be material. Comparative figures were for 12 months to March 31, 1996.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss on provision for diminution in value of marketable securities.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
